 areas and paths for jogging enthusiasts. The stunning views that can be enjoyed from the apartments will leave no one indifferent.The excellent location of Creek Views near Dubai Creek makes it easy to get to any of Dubai's attractions in a matter of minutes. There is a water cab next to the complex and the metro station is a 5-minute walk away. It is a 10-minute drive to the center of Dubai and a 10-minute drive to Dubai International Airport.","price":1848409,"title":"Creek Views","bitrix":{"id":730,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Creek Views","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Creek Views","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Iraz Developments","project_location":"Al Jaddaf"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/340x252/7Q2DozrpnvM2eRG0HzrFa7inooZbtgKiuN91PQKG.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/464x312/7Q2DozrpnvM2eRG0HzrFa7inooZbtgKiuN91PQKG.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2283142,"lng":55.2564342},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/340x252/Sk7VHDuGfMH74Aih3bNKZB1yUXiH7XetckmR4bEn.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/464x312/Sk7VHDuGfMH74Aih3bNKZB1yUXiH7XetckmR4bEn.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/340x252/FcUuAzErVieKSnhKSfwnxkBmRfNqZKPYfmMbnBxe.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/464x312/FcUuAzErVieKSnhKSfwnxkBmRfNqZKPYfmMbnBxe.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/340x252/ioKi9UTDp0bwViRbboryYq0Yk83cryq9RdpBnh0h.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/images/2024/06/21/464x312/ioKi9UTDp0bwViRbboryYq0Yk83cryq9RdpBnh0h.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2258/